msgctxt "64"
msgid "Welcome! What can I get ya today?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Hm? Did the ownership change recently?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"I guess you could say that. My son was running this place\r\n"
"before..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"... But I sent him off to Kyushu to learn how to make ramen\r\n"
"the old-fashioned way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "I'm here to mind the place while he's gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"Kyushu No. 1 Star is famous for its authentic tonkotsu broth. S'got a real "
"kick to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"I don't mean to brag, but ya haven't tried real ramen till you've had it "
"the Kyushu way! And boy do we deliver!"
msgstr ""

